'''Prince of Darkness''' (魔王の豪邸 ''Maō no Gōtei'', "'''Mansion of the Demon King'''" or "'''Mansion of Satan'''") is the 22nd sub-chapter of [[Stories of Legend]]. It was added in [[Version 3.4 Update|Version 3.4]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], it is the 15th sub-chapter in the Stories of Legend and is available up to 3★ difficulty.

==Difficulty==
Three of the stages in this sub-chapter aren't too bad, but the other three are incredibly hard. Whether you're dealing with constantly spawning [[R.Ost]]s accompanied by [[Trolly Blogger]]s; [[Kory]], [[Rain D.]] and [[Camelle]] all at once or three boss fights in one stage, you'll have a handful. Having most of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]]' [[True Form]]s and [[:Category:Crazed Cats|Crazed Cats]] is almost essential, or else this could be unnecessarily difficult. Overall, definitely more of a challenge than [[Stairway to Darkness]].
{{LegendDiff|120|140|130}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces two new enemies:
*[[Trolly Blogger]]: A peon enemy similar to [[Those Guys]], except with longer range, higher speed and an annoying knockback ability.
*[[Metal Doge]]: A [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] version of [[Doge]] with a faster attack rate, Area Attack and above-average DPS. Has the regular Metal ability of only taking 1 damage per hit, and is usually spammed to protect stronger enemies.

