==Trivia==
*Prince of Darkness's and [[Satan's Bedroom]]'s Japanese names can be literally translated as "Demon King's Mansion" and "Demon King's Bedroom" respectively; this may have foreshadowed [[Infernal Tyrant Nyandam]], whose Japanese name is Great Demon King Nyandam.

